# OpenAI integration

- Keys only from environment (`OPENAI_API_KEY`); never embed in frontend
- Use models configured via env (`OPENAI_MODEL`, `OPENAI_TRANSCRIPTION_MODEL`)
- Prompts must not instruct disclosure of system secrets or other tenants' data
- Persist model outputs needed for audit (draft scores, rationales) with timestamps
- Adaptive questioning should prefer coverage gaps + evidence over generic chat
- Handle rate limits/timeouts; fail closed to a safe facilitator fallback question
- Do not send more transcript/evidence than needed for the current step
